msgid "No son modelos de Claude: son el oído (transcripción) y el separador de voces. Corren en tu GPU serverless y se pagan del saldo prepago de Runpod, fuera del presupuesto de Anthropic."
msgstr "These are not Claude models: they are the ear (transcription) and the voice separator. They run on your serverless GPU and are paid from your prepaid Runpod balance, outside the Anthropic budget."

msgid "Coste de este análisis"
msgstr "Cost of this analysis"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

msgid "Gastado este mes"
msgstr "Spent this month"

msgid "emails"
msgstr "emails"

