msgstr "Each provider's caps are below, among the settings. Hitting a cap breaks nothing: each service falls back to its alternative (AssemblyAI→GPU, GPU→CPU, email→bell)."

msgid "Coste acumulado de este vídeo"
msgstr "Total cost of this video"

msgid "Incluye reanálisis: es todo lo que este vídeo ha costado de verdad."
msgstr "Reanalyses included: everything this video has actually cost."

